          }
        }
      }
    },
    "sharedAlbums.footer": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checked albums take turns on the Home Screen Photos widget and the Photos face; with none checked, nothing changes (Featured Photos, the photo folder). Only photos already downloaded to this Mac are read — no network, nothing saved. Shared albums show for you and recognized family members; guests and people HomePlay doesn't recognize don't see them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾了的相簿会轮流出现在主屏幕的「照片」小组件和「照片」表盘上；一本都不勾就照旧（精选照片、照片文件夹）。只读这台 Mac 上已经下载的照片，不联网、不存档。共享相簿认出你或家人时显示，访客和认不出的人看不到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾選的相簿會輪流出現在主畫面的「照片」小工具和「照片」錶面上；一本都不勾就照舊（精選照片、照片資料夾）。只讀這台 Mac 上已經下載的照片，不連網、不存檔。共享相簿在認出你或家人時顯示，訪客和認不出的人看不到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
